msgid ""
"It has been some time ago that changes in the Bible text were received from "
"the Cloud."
msgstr ""
"Sudah cukup lama sejak perubahan terakhir pada teks Alkitab diterima dari "
"Cloud."

msgid ""
"This will right itself in a little time if you are connected to the Internet."
msgstr "Hal ini akan membaik sendiri dalam waktu singkat jika Anda terhubung ke Internet."

msgid "If not please do a Send/receive action."
msgstr "Jika tidak, silakan lakukan tindakan Kirim/terima."

msgid ""
"There are pending changes in the Bible text that have not yet been sent to "
"the Cloud for some time."
msgstr "Ada perubahan teks Alkitab yang tertunda dan sudah beberapa waktu belum dikirim ke Cloud."

msgid "The Cloud already had some changes in this chapter."
msgstr "Cloud sudah memiliki beberapa perubahan dalam pasal ini."

msgid "You sent some changes for this chapter too."
msgstr "Anda juga mengirim beberapa perubahan untuk pasal ini."

msgid "The Cloud merged the two."
msgstr "Cloud telah menggabungkan keduanya."

msgid "Most likely this is okay."
msgstr "Kemungkinan besar ini baik-baik saja."

msgid "You may want to check the result of the merge, whether it is correct."
msgstr "Anda mungkin ingin memeriksa hasil penggabungan, apakah sudah benar."

msgid "You have now connected to Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Anda sekarang terhubung ke Bibledit Cloud"

msgid ""
"While you were disconnected from Bibledit Cloud, you made some changes in "
"the Bible text on your device."
msgstr ""
"Selama Anda tidak terhubung kepada Bibledit Cloud, Anda membuat beberapa "
"perubahan dalam teks Alkitab dari perangkat Anda."

msgid "These changes will not be saved to Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Perubahan ini tidak akan disimpan ke Bibledit Cloud"

msgid "The unsaved text is below."
msgstr "Teks yang belum tersimpan ada di bawah ini."

msgid ""
"While sending Bible text to Bibledit Cloud, you did not have write access to "
